gametitle=Grand Theft Auto: Vice City (NTSC-U Day 1 SLUS-20552 / CRC 20B19E49)
comment=Version 1.0. Adds a right-stick Orbit camera and an on-foot first-person camera.
comment=Press D-Pad Down to toggle the camera mod on or off with stock or Zeroable modern controls.
comment=While enabled, Select cycles three Orbit distances and First Person on foot; vehicles cycle Orbit distances only.
comment=On foot, release R3 to center behind Tommy. Hold native L1 (R1 with modern on-foot controls) to center the view.
comment=Requires a full restart and memory-card load.
[GTA-PS2-Modern-Controls\Right Stick Camera and First Person - Toggle with D-Pad Down]
description=D-Pad Down toggles the mod on/off. Select cycles Orbit distances and on-foot First Person while enabled. Vehicles have Orbit only. On foot, release R3 or hold native L1 (modern R1) to center behind Tommy. Requires a full restart and memory-card load.
author=Zeroable
comment=Stock controls supported. The separate known Zeroable remapper is optional; no remapping is bundled.
comment=Do not enable alongside the older integrated camera development patch.
